  "details": "- CVE-2026-82049: resolve a hard link's target with os.path.realpath() before\n  creating the link, so extracting a hard link to a symlink stored deeper in\n  the archive cannot relocate that symlink to a shallower path where its\n  relative target escapes the destination directory\n- CVE-2026-11940: re-filter the fallback member when hard link extraction\n  falls back to extracting from the archive, and filter it under the link's\n  own name, so a hard link to a deeper symlink cannot recreate that symlink\n  at a shallower path outside the destination. Carries the CVE-2025-4330\n  fallback-filtering prerequisite (LinkFallbackError and\n  makelink_with_filter), which this package did not have\n- CVE-2025-4435: skip a member the extraction filter rejects instead of\n  extracting it unfiltered when TarFile.errorlevel is 0",
